        "name": "Starlight's Touch",
        "description": "Heals nearby allied champions based on charges stored. Bravado-empowered attacks grant a charge of Starlight's Touch.",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Gain a stack (max 1/2/3/4/5) every 15 seconds and when hitting a <span>Bravado</span> Attack.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Consume all stacks to restore <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(25 + (15% Ability Power) + (1% Health)) Health</span> per stack to nearby ally champions (<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(25/50/75/100/125 + (15/30/45/60/75% Ability Power) + (1/2/3/4/5% Health))</span> at 1/2/3/4/5 stacks).",
